306
00:15:46.424 --> 00:15:50.264
settings internationally. Other jurisdictions certainly have

307
00:15:50.384 --> 00:15:51.364
strengthened

308
00:15:52.804 --> 00:15:54.904
regulatory powers in recent years.

309
00:15:55.624 --> 00:15:59.204
So Australia, the EU, and the UK, they have

310
00:15:59.264 --> 00:16:02.764
introduced civil penalties for breaches of their privacy legislation,

311
00:16:03.204 --> 00:16:07.124
and the fines are in the millions. Australia, I think, most recently has gone up to

312
00:16:07.164 --> 00:16:07.924
